---
module: backend
func_id: demo-history
---

***conformance tests***

# history-is-replayed
After a reset, `GET /api/patients/p3/timeline` has trace sessions of levels 1, 2 and 3 and check-ins, all on days before "2026-11-21".

# clinician-closed-alert
After a reset, `GET /api/alerts?status=closed` has an alert of patient "p5" closed by "dr. Ana Novak" with outcome "called_reassured".

# open-alerts-need-attention
After a reset, `GET /api/patients` has `counters.needsAttention` of at least 1.

# camera-history-is-replayed
After a reset, `GET /api/patients/p3/timeline` has camera sessions of levels 1, 2 and 3 with model version "camera-seed", `qualityOk` true and an empty series, and `camera:all` trend snapshots; `GET /api/patients/p8/timeline` has no camera sessions.

# camera-false-alarm
After a reset, `GET /api/alerts?status=closed` has an alert of patient "p2" closed with outcome "false_alarm" whose triggers all have game "camera".

# camera-sparkline
After a reset, in `GET /api/patients` patient "p3" has a non-empty `cameraSparkline` and patient "p8" an empty one.
